    <<narrative_action "quit">>
===

title: outro_falling_empire_loss
---
Narrator: Commander,

{$player_faction} fought to the last. {$missions_won} of {$total_missions} engagements — every one of them hard, none of them enough.
Narrator: {$enemy_faction} now stands the victor proud and mighty. Their hegemony over the sector is now a matter of record. Our councils are silent, our routes fallen under foreign banners.

Another system-state has swallowed us whole. They speak our words, keep our feast-days, worship the same stars we named. The civil war does not erase what we are, but in the hall of the stars our prayers fall on deaf ears and our names will be forgotten.

We withdraw. For now. The embers of {$player_faction} are not entirely cold.
-> New Campaign
    <<narrative_action "new_campaign">>
-> Random Missions
    <<narrative_action "random_missions">>
-> Quit
    <<narrative_action "quit">>
===
